Test fixtures (not third-party redistribution):

`crates/picoem-harness/fixtures/monkey_island_adlib.trace` and
`crates/picoem-harness/fixtures/monkey_island_theme.trace` are CSV
captures of the externally-observable port-write traffic that an
unmodified retail copy of *The Secret of Monkey Island* generates while
running under DOSBox-X with our `dosbox-x-picogus-tap.patch` applied.
The captures record only timestamps, port numbers, and byte values
emitted at the ISA bus interface — analogous to recording the MIDI
output of a musical performance rather than its acoustic signal. No
game code, audio samples, ROM data, or other copyrighted Lucasfilm
material is redistributed here. *Monkey Island* is a trademark of
Lucasfilm Entertainment Company Ltd. LLC; the captures use the name
solely to identify their provenance.

See `crates/picoem-harness/fixtures/README.md` for the full set of
test fixtures and their roles.
